; u64.max (2^64 - 1) round-trips exactly through the integer-preserving
; eval path: parser emits Tag.number_u64, processEval lifts it to
; Value.integer_u64, let-binding preserves the variant, and the host's
; evaluated_results entry carries the exact 64-bit payload.
(let [x 18446744073709551615] x)
